{"id":"3H","title":"Flattery","part":{"n":3,"title":"Relationship to Other Persons"},"url":"/law/03-relationship-to-other-persons/3h","entries":[{"id":"3H.1","text":"Flatter is not godly and is not to be used.","refs":[{"book":"Job","chapter":32,"verses":"21-22"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":5,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":12,"verses":"2-3"}],"citation":"Job. 32:21-22; Psa. 5:9; Psa. 12:2-3."},{"id":"3H.2","text":"Do not associate with those that use flattery.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":7,"verses":"21-27"}],"citation":"Prov. 7:21-27."},{"id":"3H.3","text":"Speak not with flattering words so as to please men but rather please God who tries our heart.","refs":[{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":2,"verses":"4-5"}],"citation":"1 Thes. 2:4-5."},{"id":"3H.4","text":"Flattery is a corrupting influence.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":7,"verses":"21-27"},{"book":"Daniel","chapter":11,"verses":"21"}],"citation":"Prov. 7:21-27; Dan. 11:21 32."},{"id":"3H.5","text":"Beware of those who speak many words, flattering people to gain advantage.","refs":[{"book":"Jude","chapter":1,"verses":"16"}],"citation":"Jude 1:16."},{"id":"3H.6","text":"Punishment for flattery.","refs":[{"book":"Job","chapter":17,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":12,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Job 17:5; Psa. 12:3."},{"id":"3H.7","text":"Flattery is a snare to those that use it.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":29,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Prov. 29:5."},{"id":"3H.8","text":"A flattering mouth brings ruin.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":26,"verses":"28"}],"citation":"Prov. 26:28."}]}